# The Kotori API. Leave unset in development: the app finds the API on the same
# host as the dev server (port 4000). Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at build time, so
# the hosted web app takes this from the Vercel project's environment variables
# and a change needs a redeploy (docs/deploy.md §6).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://kotori.fly.dev

# Set to "off" to use the real sign-up and sign-in screens instead of starting
# signed in as the account `pnpm kotori dev-account` creates. Development only.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_SIGN_IN=off
